-- Synthetic SQL-query test fixture for the proposed R1 schema.
-- Execute only in a disposable PostgreSQL test database after docs/structure/01_init_20261106.sql.
-- DML only; exactly 50 deterministic rows per table (IDs 1..50), safely repeatable for this fixture via ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE.
-- Values are synthetic and non-authenticating. Users are invited and all role/market grants are inactive.
-- File rows describe synthetic metadata only; no blob objects exist. Do not use this fixture to test login, file download, or production behavior.
-- Logical references are populated with matching fixture IDs; no intended orphan references or empty-string values.
-- This file does not grant business access or create usable credentials.

